      {
        "@value": "Inverse of <https://w3id.org/iprok/integrated#hasIFCScope>: points from a <https://w3id.org/iprok/building#Element> to the <https://w3id.org/iprok/billing#BOQItem> that covers it. Optional — elements without a mapped BOQ item simply lack this predicate. Domain unspecified (antipattern #8)."
